WEBVTT

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.360
Uh, hello? Janice...?

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.740
Who the hell are you calling?

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.160
Huh? Oh, wrong number, sorry...

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:43.840
Shit...

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.930
Dammit, May! You always overdo it.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:48.690
Having an illegal weapon like this makes things even worse for you... Jonathan Washington.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:52.400
Bitch! You're no cop!

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:56.280
Rally Vincent, bounty hunter.

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.620
And I'm Minnie May!

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.410
It's <i>so</i> nice to meet you!

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:40.800
Hello. This is Gunsmith Cats.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:43.510
What? Becky, say that again?

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:49.770
Washington was arrested for drug possession... but no drugs were found.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:54.400
But if he knew there was no evidence, why did he run?

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:56.720
Still, that's what he did.

00:03:56.730 --> 00:04:03.360
Something doesn't add up. Hey, Becky, could you dig up some more dirt on him?

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.870
Well, it'll cost you.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:07.870
You bloodsucker!...Huh?

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.620
I've got a customer. Later!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:15.840
Hello. Looking for anything in particular?

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:18.880
I'd like to get some customization done.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:21.420
A police officer, Roy Coleman, recommended you.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:24.470
Certainly. Could you write down your name and address?

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.680
OK...

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:34.060
Er... You really ought to be more careful! Did you know you left a round in the chamber?

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:39.030
Sorry about that...
Is this OK?

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:44.570
Thanks. I'm guessing that you're a police officer.
You know this'll make your gun heavier, right?

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:49.990
It's for my personal collection. I'm in the
K-9 division, so I carry this on duty.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:54.790
A revolver, huh? I'd suggest bringing that in for maintenance soon.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.030
Looks like you've got some loose parts.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.460
I do...?

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:02.170
Oh, that's my partner calling.

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:06.840
Uh, you can call me at that number if you want.
I'm available for dinner on weekends.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:11.850
Thanks, but I think I'll just call you when your gun is ready.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.480
Say "Hi" to Roy for me.

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:17.770
A bulletproof heart, just like I heard. See ya!

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:20.320
Come back soon!

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:24.350
Boy! It's no wonder you can't get a man.

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:25.780
You're not helping!

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.280
Relax! A date doesn't mean you've gotta get married.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.290
Shut up!

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:31.450
Welco...

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.880
Don't worry! I come in peace.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:43.210
William Collins, ATF.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:48.260
I'm a special agent with the Bureau of
Alcohol, Tobacco, and Firearms.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:51.010
And what can we do for the Department
of Regulating Everything People Like?

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.140
Our books are up to date.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.060
Oh, no. That's not what I'm here for!

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.480
So what, then?

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:03.030
Honestly? I'd like your help on a little sting operation.

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:04.990
Say what?!

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:08.450
Can we talk this over in the back room? Hmm...?

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:15.370
So... Jonathan Washington doesn't smuggle drugs... he runs guns.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:23.090
Right. And he skipped out so he could sell enough guns to post his own bail.

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:26.670
And then I caught him before he could do that.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.090
So, why not let him escape again?

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:34.100
I'm afraid it's not that easy... which brings me to why I'm here.

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:37.480
You want us to do business with him so you can find out where the guns are?

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:42.940
Correct. Alas, we're operating on a shoestring, but... huh?

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:46.780
Sorry, but we don't have much to discuss.

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:48.570
This way to the egress!

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:54.700
Ah, bummer. I really didn't want to get a warrant to search your house...

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:57.330
Just what are you implying?

00:06:57.540 --> 00:07:01.380
"Illegal possession of weapons requiring a Class 3 license."

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:04.840
You don't have one?

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:06.880
And as for you, May Hopkins...

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:12.470
Illegal possession of explosives, multiple violations of Title 7, subchapter C...

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:17.520
Right... What do you want us to do?

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:24.440
If this works out... you'll get the license and we'll waive the $250 tax on each gun.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:31.280
Well, I'm not asking for an immediate decision. Please think it over.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:35.700
Thanks for the coffee... Oh, and one more thing...

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:37.700
Be sure to lock your doors.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.310
They just left the shop.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:03.860
Roger. I'm ready. Counting on you.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:05.020
Roger.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.700
Hey! There's nothing to eat!

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:20.950
Nothing to eat? I just went out and got dinner. Don't be so picky.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.540
I'm sick of Chinese takeout.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:26.420
And I'm sick of the pizza you always get!

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:28.710
How dare you say that!

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:32.220
Hey, but seriously. What do we do about that ATF guy?

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:37.180
What choice do we have? If we don't do what he wants, we'll both be wearing handcuffs.

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:41.100
That doesn't sound like you.
Can't we do anything?

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:44.900
Well, why don't you use some of those feminine wiles of yours?

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:48.150
You've got a thing for middle-aged men, right?

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.690
Well, at least I still <i>feel</i> young.

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:50.690
Rally!

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:54.740
Come off it, Rally. That guy has zero style.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.960
Ken, love you...

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:27.690
Hey! This is just an ordinary house. Are you sure they've got loads of guns?

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.020
Hey, man, I have a source.

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:32.490
OK. Let's do this quick.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:48.000
<i>Thieves?</i> It's been a while...

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:52.550
It's the mother lode!

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.630
What did I tell you?

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:58.260
Wow! So much variety!

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.720
Who on Earth collects this kind of stuff?

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:05.590
Hey! Take a look at this bad boy!

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.150
There's enough here to start a war!

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:16.200
Three of them. Piece of cake.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:23.040
Hey! Are you gonna blow up the house?

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:25.160
These won't make as much smoke.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:28.920
That's not the point. You keep out of this.

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:32.130
Aww...

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:36.760
Hey! The other room is filled with ammo.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:38.510
Cool. That's just what I need.

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:41.390
Man, you just can't wait to load that thing, can you?

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.180
I've always wanted to hold a gun like this.

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:47.940
Shit!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.690
Where'd he go? Huh?

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:08.500
Wait! Don't go that way!

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.810
This is a no-parking zone.

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:41.110
What do you mean, "Stay out of this"?

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:44.330
Like I said, the ATF has jurisdiction...

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:53.330
Geez, what a mess!

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:58.800
How'd you get here so quickly?
This feels like a set-up.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:01.760
Come on, how can I be involved?

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:03.890
Hmph... I smell bullshit.

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:08.680
My, what a splendid collection you have.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:12.190
It'd be a real waste to have to melt them all down.

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:16.270
Enough, already. We'll cooperate.

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:16.270
Huh?

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:19.030
You will? That'd be great!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:23.200
But on one condition. You've gotta let me do it my way.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.320
That means no tails, and no outside interference.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:29.040
You got it! Deal?

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:33.210
I don't want you anywhere near me. May... let's go!

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:35.130
Ra... Rally!

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.630
Uh... Oops!

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.380
Oh... Um...

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:41.420
It's only your panties. It's not like you're seeing anyone.

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:42.970
Shut up, you...

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.900
Why on Earth are you here?

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:05.110
Like I said, I just want to buy your "toys."

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:09.700
First you put me in jail, and now this? Well, whatever...

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:15.960
I still need cash. Cough up some front money, then we can talk about the details.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:19.420
How much do you need?

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.380
Go ask the judge.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:23.720
Oh, I gotcha.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:35.640
Okay, I made a deal with Washington. He said he'd fax me the time and place later.

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:39.860
Well done. I was right to bring you in.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:44.820
You don't need to suck up. Just remember what you promised.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:49.280
Of course. I won't get in your way.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.490
Why am I not reassured?
And another thing...

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.450
We won't tail you. You have my word!

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:57.000
Anyway... I'm counting on you.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:57.880
What?

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.240
The boss wants you.

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.500
Whah...?

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:05.670
Oh, terrific. The cat's out of the bag.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:10.510
Yes, when it comes to this case...

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:12.770
Come in.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.730
You wanted me?

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:21.070
We've got three dead agents and I haven't seen any real results. What's going on?

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.570
I've been busy.

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.530
Right... So who's on it?

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:30.200
Well... nobody...

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.450
Nobody? No one's on the case?

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:36.250
Well, I have no conclusive evidence.

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:40.670
But it looks like there's a leak...

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:42.420
Somewhere in the ATF, in the Illinois division.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:45.760
You can't be serious!
Who is it?

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:51.890
Like I told you, I've got no evidence. If I knew who it was, I'd have done something by now.

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:55.140
W... Well, I see your point.

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:56.100
What?

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.100
You have a call from a state senator.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:01.110
I'll be right with him. Hey, Bill!

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:05.690
Worst case, I'll do a little
covert work. Later...

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:06.680
I'm counting on you.

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:07.520
Yeah.

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:09.860
Hello! Yes, Black speaking!

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:14.030
It's always nice to hear from you...

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:16.200
Being the boss just means more work.

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:33.640
Why are you always doing this to me?
You're nothing but trouble.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:37.020
You always decide things without asking me!

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:37.270
What was that, Becky?

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:39.890
I said, why'd you take such a stupid job?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:42.730
I was worried, so I arranged a great gig for you.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:47.110
Look, I told you... we'll have license and tax problems if we don't do this job.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.990
So what?!

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:51.070
Rally, you got a fax.

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.490
Oh, Becky, what're you doing here?

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:58.620
That's a good question! It's obvious that my advice isn't worth squat here!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:03.170
Hey now, I'll tell you what...
I'll buy you dinner.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:06.500
No pizza or Chinese.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:15.720
Hey, Rally... Where the heck are you taking me?

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.970
All you have to do is stay in the car.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:20.680
After that, trust me,
I'll buy dinner.

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:23.440
And what do I do?

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.150
Nothing whatsoever.

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:26.520
What?!

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:29.320
Oh, I see. You're making me babysit May.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:29.570
Oh, I see. You're making me babysit May.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:30.990
Bingo

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:32.990
Now hold on a...!

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:08.730
OK... Be right back.

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:10.360
Be careful.

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:10.610
Be careful.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:16.950
Who's there?

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:21.000
Rally Vincent. I'm here to make a buy from Jonathan Washington.

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.370
Inside.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.000
Thank you.

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:33.210
You're packing, right? We'll keep them for you.

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:34.260
Okay...

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:34.510
Okay...

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:35.800
Slowly!

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:36.700
Sheesh...

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.600
Like that?

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:41.640
Give it to him.

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:43.930
What's next?

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:45.850
Any other weapons?

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:50.570
Yes. Here you go.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.190
Right! Full body check!

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:54.240
Be gentle with me.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:58.240
Sorry! Just doing my job.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.650
She's clean.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.370
Hey.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.960
Washington's upstairs.

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:11.370
You. Go with her.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.380
Yeah.

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:18.000
What an annoying bitch!

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:23.970
Who is it?

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.970
My, such good taste.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:29.940
Oh, it's you. Thanks for coming.

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:34.820
Of course I came! I did pay your bail, after all.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:38.410
By the way, when do
I get my guns back?

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:43.490
You'll get them back... as soon as you pass a little test.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:43.490
Test...?

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:46.960
Yeah. The boss told me to be very careful with you.

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:49.710
What kind of test?

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:53.210
Ahh, it's no big deal. Here... this way.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.220
Who's he?

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:00.800
Some special agent.

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:06.060
He was snooping around outside. Lucky for us, the boss spotted him.

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:12.730
Looks like I'm famous.

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:14.980
Now I remember him!

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:18.450
This is the guy who blackmailed me into setting you up.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.730
That's what I thought.

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:22.280
Rally...

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:27.790
Sorry... but things aren't going to go your way.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:30.500
So, what's this test?

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.330
Here's his gun.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:34.960
You want me to kill him?

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.380
Business is built on trust.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:38.970
Hmph!

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:45.000
Hey, where are the bullets? You don't expect me to club him to death, do you?

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:47.430
Oops! You're good!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:50.530
An amateur couldn't tell that a gun's empty just by picking it up.

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:51.440
Here...

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:54.220
Huh...? One? So much for trust.

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:55.770
The boss is careful.

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:59.070
You do know that killing a cop is bad for business?

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:09.660
By the way, I'd like some proof you've got the merchandise.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.830
No problem! I know... I've got a few samples over here.

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:16.090
Now, here's something that could come in handy.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.550
I'm looking for something more conventional.

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:23.010
Don't worry. We've got crates full of guns downstairs.

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:25.300
Ah, good.

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.730
Watch out!

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:31.850
Freeze!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:38.030
Uh... Let's talk this over.

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.650
This is what happens when you don't take a lady at her word.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.200
You too!

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.490
All the lights went out!

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:07.100
Oh my... this looks pretty bad...

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:08.220
That's my cue.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:09.890
Huh? May? How'd you get loose?

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:11.770
Don't!

00:21:11.770 --> 00:21:12.690
May...

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:20.560
Rally, you really shouldn't have deceived me.

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:22.610
Just paying you back for jumping the gun.

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:25.320
Anyway, how the hell did
you find this place?

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:29.440
Well, I may have crap fashion
sense, but I can be useful.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.910
I'm no Eliot Ness, though.

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:33.910
Uh... sure.

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:46.050
You know what? They don't trust you at all.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:49.530
Looks pretty grim. Too bad we can't grow wings and fly away.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:52.850
Suck it up. I don't intend to be
wearing a halo anytime soon.

00:21:53.140 --> 00:21:55.230
I love your optimism!

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:57.590
Hey, bossman... shall we boogie?

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:10.450
You reckless moron!

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:17.380
Over there!

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:34.390
That was close!

00:22:49.990 --> 00:22:53.120
Locked...

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:55.080
Well then...

00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:58.210
Which one should I...

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:06.840
Rally! Cover me!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:08.930
You take care of yourself!

00:23:09.130 --> 00:23:10.470
I'm in trouble too...

00:23:14.430 --> 00:23:17.390
Rally, you OK? Rally!

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:20.850
<i>I'm not one to gamble, but...</i>

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:33.160
That bitch is a crack shot.

00:23:35.410 --> 00:23:37.910
I was just aiming at the floor, but I'm not complaining.

00:23:43.130 --> 00:23:45.020
Rally, behind you!

00:23:52.890 --> 00:23:53.850
Rally!

00:24:11.490 --> 00:24:13.410
Oh... Shit!

00:24:13.700 --> 00:24:16.160
Rally? Where are you? Rally!

00:24:16.370 --> 00:24:18.290
May, look out!

00:24:22.870 --> 00:24:23.800
Rally!

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:24.760
Idiot!

00:24:26.170 --> 00:24:26.880
Die!

00:24:26.880 --> 00:24:27.670
Bill!

00:24:49.320 --> 00:24:52.280
Well, I wasn't totally useless after all, huh?

00:24:52.700 --> 00:24:55.570
Oh, sure! That was about the stupidest stunt I've ever seen!

00:24:56.870 --> 00:24:58.330
Yeah, pretty much!

00:24:59.540 --> 00:25:04.540
Bastards! It's not over yet...

00:25:04.790 --> 00:25:05.380
My turn!

00:25:14.470 --> 00:25:16.460
None of this is on me!

00:25:20.770 --> 00:25:23.850
Yes, we caught the lot of them.

00:25:31.190 --> 00:25:34.820
What is your problem? You have no sense of proportion whatsoever.

00:25:35.030 --> 00:25:37.990
And if I hadn't shown up, you'd be arriving in Hell about now.

00:25:38.200 --> 00:25:39.700
I could've taken care of myself!

00:25:39.910 --> 00:25:40.790
Oh, is that so?

00:25:40.990 --> 00:25:42.950
Hey now, you two.

00:25:42.950 --> 00:25:44.660
This was all your fault! This was all your fault!

00:25:44.870 --> 00:25:49.720
Eh? What did you say? I can't hear so well because of that explosion.

00:25:49.790 --> 00:25:51.000
What a jerk!

00:25:51.000 --> 00:25:53.920
Could he be a bigger asshole?

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:59.050
Which reminds me, I've got one more little job for you girls! How about it?

00:25:59.260 --> 00:26:02.020
Huh?! Huh?!

00:26:03.140 --> 00:26:04.850
You're joking... You're joking...

00:28:46.850 --> 00:28:50.100
Just when we thought we were done with this gun-smuggling business...

00:28:50.310 --> 00:28:54.940
...you wouldn't believe who contacted us and asked us to help him escape!

00:28:55.150 --> 00:28:57.980
Bill from the ATF isn't very trustworthy.

00:28:57.980 --> 00:29:00.940
And to make matters worse, there's this crazy Russian running around too!

00:29:01.150 --> 00:29:03.950
You'd better be extra careful. That
Russian's a real psycho!

00:29:04.160 --> 00:29:06.120
Aah! Rally, help!

00:29:06.320 --> 00:29:07.780
Oh! May!

00:29:07.990 --> 00:29:11.870
The next episode of Gunsmith Cats!
Chapter 2! "Swing High."

00:29:12.290 --> 00:29:15.540
Just wait 'til you see me drive!
